--------+---------+---------------+-----------+------------+------------+-------------+---------+---------
 chat1  | b1      | chat-remote-2 | chat      |            |          1 |           2 |       2 | chat
 embed1 | b1      | embed-remote  | embedding |          8 |            |             |       1 | 
(2 rows)

